      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "The public entry point is the aspose.cells_foss package, with Workbook as the primary class for creating and manipulating workbooks. Each Workbook contains one or more Worksheet objects, and each Worksheet exposes a Cells collection for accessing individual Cell instances."
    },
